      "instance_name": "newport_cigarette_brand",
      "label": "Newport Cigarette Brand",
      "description": "The phrase 'asked me for a Newport' references the cigarette brand Newport, which is a real-world product. The joke implies that the steak is so dark (overcooked) that it is 'asking' for a cigarette, which is a crude and absurd comparison. Understanding the reference to Newport requires knowledge of this specific cigarette brand and its cultural context as a product associated with smoking.",
